The Android companion is a community application for the GTDdo fork of tududi.
It is not an official Google, Samsung or tududi Android application.

The task/check and close vector paths are from Google Material Design Icons,
Copyright Google LLC, licensed under Apache License 2.0:
https://github.com/google/material-design-icons
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The task/check icon is used in an adaptive GTDdo launcher icon and as a
monochrome system tile glyph. System-provided icon masking and tinting apply.
